    "Question #: 7": {
      "Title": "Exam 70-698 topic 1 question 121 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Note: This question is part of a series of questions that use the same scenario. For your convenience, the scenario is repeated in each question. Each question presents a different goal and answer choices, but the text of the scenario is exactly the same in each question in this series."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "https://www.examtopics.com/assets/media/exam-media/02182/0013600001.png"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Your network contains a single Active Directory domain named adatum.com. The network contains five servers configured as shown in the following table."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "https://www.examtopics.com/assets/media/exam-media/02182/0013600002.png"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "All of the servers run Windows Server 2012 R2."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Test_Server has a shared folder named ShareA. Only local users have permissions to ShareA."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The network contains a mainframe computer that is administered by using the Telnet protocol."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The domain contains four client computers configured as shown in the following table:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "https://www.examtopics.com/assets/media/exam-media/02182/0013600003.png"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "All of the client computers run the 64-bit version of Windows. User3 frequently accesses ShareA. Remote Desktop is enabled on Computer4."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Your company identifies the following requirements:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Ensure that you can test unsigned device drivers on Computer1"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Enable Credential Guard on Computer2."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Run commands and cmdlets remotely on Computer2."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Configure User Account Control (UAC) on Computer3 to prompt administrators for credentials when elevated privileges are required."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Ensure that User1 can view and interact with a desktop session of User3."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Ensure that User2 can use Telnet to manage the mainframe."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Ensure that User4 can use Remote Desktop to access Computer4 remotely."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "https://www.examtopics.com/assets/media/exam-media/02182/0013700008.png"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You need to meet the requirement of User4."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "What should you do?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. Install a Universal Windows Platform (UWP) application."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. Modify the membership of a local group."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. Install a Windows feature."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. Modify the settings of the primary network adapter."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: B \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          }
        ]
